==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Cutiefly|92}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.
*This card's illustration rare print forms a {{TCG|narrative illustration}} with the illustration rare print of {{TCG ID|Celestial Guardians|Morelull|157}}; both cards are illustrated by [[kamonabe]].
*{{DL|Skill (Shuffle)|Flap}} is a {{OBP|skill|Shuffle}} in [[Pokémon Shuffle]], though {{p|Cutiefly}} cannot have it. As an attack in the TCG, it first appeared on {{TCG ID|Majestic Dawn|Starly|75}} from {{TCG|Majestic Dawn}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

